===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*pewH-}}
From {{suffix|en|compute|er|id2=agent noun}}.  {{doublet|en|cantore|counter|kontor}}.

Sense 1 first attested in 1613 by the poet {{w|Richard Brathwait}}.

Sense 2 first attested in 1897 in the ''{{w|Engineering (magazine)|Engineering}}'' magazine.

